---
/**
 * @license MIT
 * ============================================================================
 * src/pages/corporate.astro — Corporate Architecture Route (`/corporate`)
 * ============================================================================
 * PLAIN-ENGLISH OVERVIEW (100-LEVEL JAVASCRIPT & ASTRO 6 GUIDE):
 * What is this file?
 *   Maps `src/pages/corporate.astro` to the public URL `/corporate` under
 *   Astro 6's file-based routing convention.
 *
 * How does it fit into the build lifecycle?
 *   - Data Inputs: `raggiesoft-assets/engine-room-records/json/corporate-structure.json`
 *     (the hierarchical org-chart tree) and `src/data/ported-pages.json` (73 deep
 *     archival dossiers).
 *   - Static Compilation: `scripts/build.mjs` calls `renderCorporatePage(corporateStructure)`
 *     from `src/renderers/pages-core.mjs`, appends the 73-route Master Archive
 *     Index, and writes `./dist/corporate/index.html`.
 *
 * What visible UI does `/corporate` produce?
 *   Pillar 3 of Engine Room Records:
 *   1. Legal & Canonical Boundary: Distinguishes the real-world unincorporated
 *      creative brand (**Engine Room Records**, strictly NO "LLC") from fictitious
 *      in-universe narrative entities (*Engine Room Records, LLC*, founded in 1992
 *      by Holly O'Connell, and *The O'Connell Family Revocable Trust*).
 *   2. Recursive Corporate Org Chart: Nested semantic cards rendering every parent
 *      trust and subsidiary LLC from `corporate-structure.json`.
 *   3. Sanctuary Properties & Rolling Fleet Overview + 73-dossier directory grid.
 * ============================================================================
 */

// Import the shared outer HTML layout shell inside Astro's build-time `---` code fence.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<!-- Configure page-level SEO and OpenGraph metadata on BaseLayout for `/corporate` -->
<BaseLayout
  title="Corporate Architecture & Lore | Engine Room Records"
  description="Real-world imprint (Engine Room Records) vs. in-universe conglomerate (Engine Room Records, LLC & The O'Connell Family Trust)."
  canonicalPath="/corporate"
>
  <!-- Hydrated with corporate-structure.json org tree and 73-dossier index via scripts/build.mjs -->
</BaseLayout>
